stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Preparing: choose
    Preparing --> Idle: back
    Preparing --> Recording: Start (accepted once)
    Recording --> Paused: Pause
    Paused --> Recording: Resume
    Recording --> Finishing: Finish (strength, recovery)
    Paused --> Finishing: Finish (every activity)
    Finishing --> Paused: Back to session
    Finishing --> Saving: Save
    Finishing --> Discarded: Discard + confirm
    Saving --> Saved: result confirmed
    Saving --> SaveFailed: result is failure
    Saving --> SaveUnknown: no result
    SaveUnknown --> Saving: Check again (no second record)
    SaveFailed --> Saving: Try again
    SaveFailed --> Paused: Back to session
    SaveUnknown --> Paused: Back to session
    Saved --> Review: optional
    Review --> Closed: Save review / Skip
    Saved --> Closed: Done
    Discarded --> Closed
    Recording --> Interrupted: app ended
    Paused --> Interrupted: app ended
    Interrupted --> Paused: reopen - only what was stored
    Closed --> [*]
    note right of Recording
      Minimised is not a state: it is
      which screen is shown. It never
      pauses, resets, completes or
      starts anything.
    end note
